# Synthesizer Labship below the 2+ striation: Memnite's station puts one charge counter on it, so at the beginning of combat on turn 3 the ability is not there and Mox Pearl stays a plain artifact. Memnite untaps and stations again on turn 5: two counters is exactly the 2+ striation, so at the beginning of combat Mox Pearl becomes a 2/2 flying artifact creature (CR 721.2a).

